# A turn that stops to make room for itself. `/compact` takes the working
# indicator down and puts a compaction one where it was, so the word
# `Working...` is off the pane for the whole of it while a call nobody can
# interrupt usefully runs. The agent is still there afterwards, the way pi is:
# whoever is driving this scenario decides when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen working
sleep 50
screen compacting
sleep 600000
